      "unidentified": "",
      "value": "<p>You cause water in the spell’s area to instantly boil, dealing 7d8 fire damage to creatures that fail a Reflex save. Creatures that save take half damage. This spell has no effect in vacuum, deals half damage in normal and thin atmosphere, and deals full damage in thick atmosphere and underwater.</p>"
